# Hemal Trainer Management System - Phase 2 Complete

Phase 2 of the Hotel Training Management System is now fully implemented! This phase focused on Attendance mechanisms and On-The-Job Training (OJT) supervision.

## Overview of Phase 2 Changes

### 1. Attendance & QR Integration
- **Backend (`routes/attendance.js`)**: Created new API endpoints to handle QR Code attendance. 
  - `POST /api/attendance/generate-qr`: Generates a secure, time-expiring base64 token for a training session.
  - `POST /api/attendance/scan`: Allows employees to scan and automatically records them as 'Present' in the DB.
- **Frontend (`pages/Schedule.jsx`)**: Designed a luxury Daily/Weekly Training Schedule calendar view. Training managers can view today's sessions and click the **"Generate QR"** button to allow staff to scan for attendance.

### 2. On-The-Job Training (OJT) Evaluation
- **Backend (`routes/ojt.js`)**: Upgraded the POST endpoint to support complex assessments, including `rating` (1-5 stars), `assessment_notes`, and a definitive `pass_fail` boolean.
- **Frontend (`pages/OJT.jsx`)**: Created a beautiful Supervisor Assessment terminal. It includes:
  - An interactive Skill Checklist
  - A 1-to-5 Star Performance Rating selector
  - A definitive Pass/Fail verdict
  - Text area for trainer notes

## How to Test
If your frontend development server is still running from Phase 1, you will immediately see two new tabs on the left-side navigation panel:
1. **Schedule**: Click here to view the daily training calendar and the QR Code generator buttons.
2. **OJT Assessment**: Click here to view the supervisor terminal for rating employees on-the-job.

> [!TIP]
> **What's Next?** Phase 3 covers the complex Integrations: **OCR Data Extraction** (for scanning physical attendance sheets) and **Google Forms Integration** (for syncing training feedback).
